[["heading","SECTION 33 / INTERVIEW PREPARATION"],["heading","Quick revision: technical follow-ups"],["heading","Question\nSimple answer"],["text","Authentication vs\nauthorization?\nWho you are vs what you may access."],["text","JWT vs session?\nSelf-contained token verification vs server-side session lookup; hybrid designs\nexist."],["text","REST API?\nResource-oriented HTTP interface; validate and authorize requests on server."],["text","SQL vs MongoDB?\nRelational constraints vs document-oriented storage; requirements decide."],["text","Why index?\nSpeed selected reads at storage and write-maintenance cost."],["text","Payment verification?\nUse trusted provider evidence, verify expected fields; do not trust browser\nreturn."],["text","Idempotency?\nRepeating an operation should not repeat its intended side effect."],["text","NGINX?\nWeb server and reverse proxy; role depends on configuration."],["text","SEO?\nImprove discovery, indexing and usefulness; no ranking guarantees."],["text","QA vs debugging?\nVerify behavior vs locate and fix root cause."],["text","Agile vs CI?\nIterative collaboration vs frequent integration with automated checks."],["text","AI API privacy?\nProtect keys and minimize sensitive inputs; validate outputs."],["heading","Recall test"],["sinhala","","For each concept say one definition, one example from your CV if verified, and one limitation. දන්නා",479],["sinhala","","concept එකකේ තමන් කළ වෙුඩකේ Jලස Jනාකියන්න.",258]]